# SCPN MIF Liner Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN MIF Liner Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for the mechanical/liquid-liner
  magnetised-target fusion configuration within the SCPN Reactor Systems
  Research Group. Evidence maturity computational_prototype: a validated
  device configuration model, diagnostic and clock semantics aligned with
  the SCPN Phase Orchestrator observability catalogue, level-0 device
  physics (the mass, kinetic energy, drive pressure and characteristic
  time of a driven annular liner, and ideal flux and adiabatic compression
  recorded as upper bounds), and tessellated and B-rep models of the
  liner, its coaxial return conductor and end electrodes. Parameter sets
  are synthetic or anchored on a filed design study; no real machine is
  described, and the claim inventory is empty.
authors:
